  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'><p>Like a trusted compass for your feet, the ASICS GEL-Kayano 20 guides every journey with precision. Launched in 2013, these sneakers blend comfort and innovation with dual GEL inserts and a GUIDANCE TRUSSTIC system for lasting support and stability mile after mile. Up top, the architectural aesthetics inspired by buildings and cars create a bold, distinctive look that reflects the technical aesthetic of the 2010s, whispering understated sophistication. Underneath, GEL cushioning in the rearfoot and forefoot absorbs impact to keep your stride light, no matter the distance. Featuring an upper with at least 30% synthetic fibre, these shoes strike a perfect balance between durability and performance without compromising on style. Carry the weight of history and the lightness of innovation with the ASICS GEL-Kayano 20.</p> <p><strong>ASICS GEL-Kayano 20 features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>FLUIDFIT cage upper ensures a supportive, glove-like fit.</li> <li>Criss-cross TPU application provides targeted support.</li> <li>Mesh underlays offer breathability.</li> <li>Rubber outsole delivers superior traction.</li> </ul><hr /><p>Long days on your feet call for comfort you can count on and style that still stands out. First released in 2013, the ASICS GEL-Kayano 20 brings back a technical running icon with everyday wearability, pairing dual GEL cushioning and a GUIDANCE TRUSSTIC system with a layered, early-2010s design inspired by architecture and automotive lines. The result is a supportive, cushioned ride with a bold retro-tech look that feels just as good on the move as it does in rotation.</p> <ul><li>FLUIDFIT cage upper helps create a supportive, glove-like feel.</li><li>Criss-cross TPU detailing adds targeted structure and a distinctive technical finish.</li><li>Mesh underlays provide breathable comfort.</li><li>Rearfoot and forefoot GEL cushioning helps absorb impact.</li><li>Rubber outsole offers durable traction.</li><li>Upper contains at least 30% synthetic fiber.</li></ul> <p><strong>Styling & Versatility</strong></p> <p>With its sculpted midsole, layered overlays, and performance-rooted design language, this pair brings standout texture to casual outfits without losing comfort. It is an easy choice for everyday wear when you want heritage running energy, cushioned support, and a look that leans confidently into the 2010s tech aesthetic.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS®</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>ASICS® GEL-Kayano 20 - Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Women's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Cream/Independence Blue</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - B - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Premium upper with durable overlays and responsive traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>1203A388-104</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">ASICS® Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Women's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p st